Package: achma-tray
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Maintainer: achma-learning <achma-learning@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi (>= 3.30), python3-gi-cairo, python3-cairo, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-pango-1.0
Suggests: gnome-shell-extension-appindicator, gir1.2-gtklayershell-0.1
Homepage: https://github.com/achma-learning/html-files
Description: prayer day spine and AI chatbot launcher in the system tray
 Two tray apps for Moroccan users, built from the pages in "html file/":
 .
  * Prayer Spine (prayer-tray): city, weather, the day drawn to scale and the
    countdown to the next prayer. Times are computed locally with the
    Moroccan Ministry method, for 57 Moroccan cities or any custom location.
    Notifications before and at each adhan.
  * AI Hub (ai-hub-tray): one click or Ctrl+Alt+A to open ChatGPT, Claude,
    Gemini and a dozen more, each in its own window.
 .
 Uses the StatusNotifierItem tray protocol: works in KDE Plasma and XFCE as
 they are, and in GNOME with the AppIndicator extension (preinstalled on
 Ubuntu).
